	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Good morning, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Good morning.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"I respectfully lower my head.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Empress Hisui─Kanami─steps out of the black car that brought her to school.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"When I raise my head, I make eye contact with her smiling expression.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Kanami is tirelessly working every day to bring democracy to the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Yet even with her busy schedule, she still finds the time to come to school.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I escort Kanami to her classroom.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Since we're in different years, we aren't able to attend the same classes.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Once I ensure that another warrior is present to see to her safety, I withdraw from Kanami's side.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Kanami raises a tiny voice.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"She fixes me with a pair of entreating eyes.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What might be the matter, Your Majesty?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“P-Pay it no mind. You may take your leave.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"I offer her a deep bow in response.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"By the time I raise my head, all I catch is a faint glimpse of\nKanami's back before she disappears into her classroom.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"My head remains in the clouds throughout the whole class as I wonder what Kanami was about to say to me.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"The contents of the lesson go in one ear and out the other.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"I can't help but be concerned.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Could she be feeling under the weather?",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Could she be pushing herself too hard?",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"...It's only natural to be worried about her, right?",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Tei!”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"All of a sudden, a chop lands on top of my head with a dull clonk.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You didn't even react.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mh... How careless of me.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Before I know it, class is already dismissed, and we're on recess.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's got you spacing out?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...I wasn't.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okay, look, it's super obvious that you wanna be with Her Majesty. It's practically written all over your face.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You wear your feelings on your sleeve more than you think.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"She informs me with a sigh.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is it really that obvious?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You could give an abandoned puppy a run for its money.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"It's that bad, huh?",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You need to pull yourself together, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Go on then, get going. Consider it an order.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Making my own lord worry about me like this... I've still got a long way to go.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"All the same, I accept her kindness and fly out of the classroom with a bow.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"It doesn't take me long to find Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Standing by herself at the end of a lonely hallway, she's leaning over the handrail with a melancholic expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Her warrior escort, positioned a respectful distance away from her, immediately takes notice of me.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll take over for Her Majesty's security. You may return to the visitors' lounge.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"I relieve the warrior of his post, and he withdraws with a bow.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I gently call out to Kanami as she continues wistfully staring down at the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii─Tokita?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"We're still in public, and Kanami manages to catch herself in time.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Whatever brings you here?”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Could it be that you came to call on me?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Hearing this, Kanami instantly brightens up so much that I wonder if she's about to start jumping for joy.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you doing here?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Staying in the classroom makes me feel rather restless.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Though I am glad that the other students are willing to converse with me.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Empress Hisui is as popular as ever.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"In fact, she's probably even more popular now.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Take care not to push yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“No, I am not pushing myself at all.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am only attending school because it is what I wish for.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Kanami says with a smile, but to me, it seems rather strained.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"She may be able to fool everyone else, but she can't fool me.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At the very least... is there anything I can do for you?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“No, I am happy merely to have you by my side.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Her words fill me up with a curious mixture of happiness and loneliness.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"As I stare at her in silence, Kanami fidgets bashfully and breaks away from my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“However, um...”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Well, that is, if you might be so kind...”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please, ask me for anything at all.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Is she going to confide to me what she tried to say earlier this morning?",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Um... Umm...”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Kanami blushes and squirms as she tries to work up the courage.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Indifferent to her distress, the warning bell rings out heartlessly.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Our time together is up.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Let us return to our classrooms.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Yes, we should.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Kanami nods dejectedly, her shoulders slumped in disappointment.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"In the end, I never did find out what Kanami was trying to say to me.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Morning classes end and make way for lunch break.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"I pop my head into the student council office, having been summoned there by Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Welcome, Onii-sama. I have been waiting for you.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Please, come on in.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Kanami greets me from within the room and gestures towards an empty seat.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"The two of us are all alone.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's this?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"My eyes involuntarily widen.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"There are two lunchboxes spread open on the conference table.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You are always taking care of me, Onii-sama, so I thought to return the favor.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“If it is not a bother, I would be delighted if you would eat your fill.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you make this yourself?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Y-Yes. I borrowed the kitchen this morning. It may not be very good, though.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, there's no way. It looks delicious.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"The dishes that Kanami prepared are made entirely from seasonal ingredients, making for a bright and beautiful meal.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"But rather than a luxurious meal fit for an Empress, it conveys the impression of a humble, home-cooked lunch.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are we really allowed to eat lunch here in the student council office, though?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I begged Elsa-sama until she granted me her permission.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Kanami moves to prepare some tea when I sit down.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At least let me take care of the tea.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Please, leave it to me. It's my pleasure.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"I might be the only person in the Empire who gets to drink tea brewed by the Empress herself.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"When I bring the teacup to my mouth, I make eye contact with Kanami, eagerly watching for my reaction with bated breath.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Please, have a taste.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't mind if I do, then.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Y-Yes! Please do!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Kanami sits up straight as an arrow.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Even I'm nervous now for some reason.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"I've enjoyed Kanami's homemade cooking many times before, so I should have no need to feel nervous.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"I reach my chopsticks towards the omelettes and put one in my mouth.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Its light sweetness spreads across my palate.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"The tender, slightly fluffy texture of the eggs gently envelops my tongue.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"It's a simple, nostalgic flavor, one that stirs up a flood of fond memories.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“How do you find it?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"She stares intently at me, a concerned expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's delicious.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Truly?”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. It's a taste that sorta takes me back.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"A smile spreads across Kanami's face at my comment.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"A soft, familiar smile that warms me to the bottom of my heart.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can I have some more?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Yes! Eat to your heart's content! I made plenty!”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Kanami gazes at me contentedly as I move my chopsticks.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Aren't you going to eat?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hehee, I was so absorbed in watching you eat that it slipped my mind.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Do not mind if I do, then.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Kanami briefly puts her hands together before reaching out with her chopsticks.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“It's been so long since we've eaten together, has it not?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"She murmurs lonesomely, even as she keeps up the smile on her face.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Kanami is Her Imperial Majesty, and I am but a mere warrior.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"It is only natural that opportunities to dine at the same table don't come easily for us.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry I make you feel so lonely.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“That isn't the case at all!”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Your Kanami only makes it through every day from the thought that you are always watching over her.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Once the Empire is fully democratized and Kanami is able to abdicate her throne, we may be able to spend more time with each other.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"But only Oomikami knows how many years that might take.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Is there nothing I can do for Kanami, right here and now?",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"After our lunch together, I escort Kanami back to her classroom.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"But when I turn to make my leave, Kanami grabs the sleeve of my uniform.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“U-Um, Onii-sama. Might I have a bit of your time?”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's up?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“This way, please.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Kanami leads me by the hand to an empty classroom that\nisn't being used next period.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"She turns to face me, hesitantly interlacing her fingers.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is this a conversation you don't want anyone else to hear?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Um, well...”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Talk to me. You've been waiting all day to say it, right?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“That is indeed the case, but, um...”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"She blushes and turns her head down.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"It must be embarrassing for her to talk about.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"That alone is enough for me to guess what Kanami wants from me.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"When I reach out to pat her on the head, she looks up at me with flushed cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do you want from me?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Ooh...”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Embarrassed that I've seen right through what she wants, Kanami looks down once again.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"She just craves the physical contact she's been deprived of for so long.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"But her bashfulness and her status as the Empress are preventing her from saying it aloud.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Though the two of us siblings have already crossed that particular line, we are certainly in no way used to it.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I-I wish for you to... hold me tight.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"I wrap her up in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Her very small, very fragile body trembles heartachingly in my embrace.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Could you please... touch me more directly?”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Like this?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"I caress Kanami's cheek with my palm.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Her soft skin is warm to the touch.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“My lips, too...”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"I brush her flower petal lips with my thumb.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"The luscious sensation lingers on my fingertip.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Not with your finger... but with your lips... please.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"I do as I'm told and gently lay my lips on top of hers.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Nm... nnm...”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"The point of contact between us begins to heat up at once.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"The heat that she transmits to me sets my entire body burning as though it's on fire.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hahh... nnh... nnm... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Leaning further into our embrace, the two of us entirely forget that we are in a place of learning.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"We place our mutual passion for each other over the risk of someone coming into the classroom.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"The students next door could surely never guess that Empress Hisui is right here, touching her lips to those of a man.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Haahh... mwah, mwah... nnmmh...”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Parting our lips, I stare into Kanami's eyes as she tries to steady her ragged breathing.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"Lacking all traces of Empress Hisui's majestic mien, her flushed face instead resembles only the concupiscent countenance of a maiden pining after the object of her affections.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"The mere taste of her lips isn't enough to satisfy me either.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"I want to taste more and more of her.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Um, Onii-sama... Truthfully, there is a matter of which I've been unable to speak since this morning, out of fear that you might become disillusioned with me...”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No need to worry.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm probably thinking the same thing you are right now.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“R-Really?”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I'm sure.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Peering into Kanami's eyes, I give voice to the words I've been holding in my heart.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I want to make love to you.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Your Kanami... wishes for you to make love to her as well.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Just as I thought, we both want the same thing.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I cannot put it out of my mind... that night you made me yours.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Same here.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"The memories of that night are seared vividly into my brain and my flesh.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Kanami, too, must have been spending her days as Empress Hisui in a similar state as me.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Ordinarily, I should be taking her someplace more appropriate, such as my room.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"But I silently nod in acquiescence to her request.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"The afternoon bell rings out to signal the start of classes.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"But our feverish desire for each other cannot be quenched so easily.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Outside the classroom, the hustle and bustle of students rushing to class can clearly be heard.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"But even that too melts away into the background as our lips join together once again.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Nnh... nnm... *kiss, kiss...* nnh, nnmh...!”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"Our lips come together with a ravenous kiss.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"We practically devour each other as we unleash our long-suppressed desires.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"When I finally let go of her lips, Kanami leans all her weight into me, peering up at me with moist, teary eyes.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You know, we probably went and overdid it.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"We'd be incredibly late if we tried to show up to class now.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We should probably avoid doing it at school from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hweh...?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"Kanami lets slip a disappointed murmur.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Your Kanami... she does not mind.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"She bashfully continues, barely above a whisper.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“A-After all, it felt really good doing it in a classroom...”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...Am I strange for thinking so?”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You sure are.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Oooooohhh...”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Kanami trembles with shame as her eyes fill with tears.",
			},
		},
